  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/610492/description_19c704fd-83da-48c6-93bc-c39ae13831db.png\" alt=\"又一個傢俱模組\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maQ6tE6Nsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1378839788659933345?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yet-another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1209908?style=flat-square&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=CurseForge&amp;color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyet-another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/yet-another-furniture?style=flat-square&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yet-another-furniture/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-1.20.1-6b6b88?style=flat-square&amp;logo=minecraft&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"版本\"></a></p><h3>⚠️ 注意：</h3><p>此模組正<strong><em>被徹底重組</em></strong>並合併至《Building But Better》的翻新版中。合併完成後，本模組將不再維護，但我會在BBB中實作相關功能，確保過渡平順，避免方塊消失。感謝您的理解！</p><hr><h3>📋 關於</h3><p><strong>又一個傢俱模組</strong>是一個傢俱模組，旨在替代原《Another Furniture》模組，後者的整體概念與品牌定位已完全定型。本模組是對原創模組的重新構想，以全新美術風格帶來新功能與方塊。</p><p>包含抽屜、沙發、燈具、櫥櫃等多種傢俱類型！</p>",
